# trx64u.cor is TRX64-Ultimate's file (T239.3 D21, P1-8): their CI builds, tests and delivers it, this package takes it by its sha256 and changes no byte
# (ci/imports.py pack copies it from the builder's store, finish checks it again). Shell variables. Their build is the file COR_FILE of the generic package
# PACKAGE, version VERSION, of their Gitea registry; a later build is a new pin (VERSION, COR_FILE, COR_SHA256, COR_SIZE), reviewed.
# The name PACKAGE/VERSION/COR_FILE is all the pin says; where the registry is comes from the environment of the builder (ci/imports.py, TRX_FW_PKG_URL).
ID=trx64u
PACKAGE=trx64-ultimate
VERSION=u18-82fe1b90
COR_FILE=trx64u_82fe1b90.cor
COR_SHA256=b4e184bdc31b01c6ee43849dad154c0a160a57c2c03843d1dd83ed1c2594592b
COR_SIZE=3987048
